{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/insomnia/","title":"불면의 한의학적 임상 추론","language":"ko-KR","description":"불면을 심비양허·담음·음혈부족 등의 구조로 구분하고 귀비탕·온담탕·산조인·경혈로 연결합니다.","text":"불면의 한의학적 임상 추론\n1. 수면 양상\n입면 곤란인지, 자주 깨는지, 조기각성인지와 함께 심계·피로·소화·담·열감 등의 동반증상을 살핀다.\n2. 변증\n불면\n├─ 피로·심계·건망 → 심비양허\n├─ 더부룩함·담·흉민 → 담음·담위불화\n└─ 허번·자양부족 → 음혈부족 계열\n3. 치법\n심비양허 → 보기양혈·안신 → 귀비탕\n담음 → 화담·이기 → 온담탕\n안신 본초 → 산조인\n4. 경혈\n→ 신문 HT7\n→ 내관 PC6\n→ 삼음교 SP6\n→ 백회 GV20\n→ 불면 임상연구","sections":[{"title":"1. 수면 양상","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/insomnia/#1","text":"입면 곤란인지, 자주 깨는지, 조기각성인지와 함께 심계·피로·소화·담·열감 등의 동반증상을 살핀다.","links":[]},{"title":"2. 변증","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/insomnia/#2","text":"불면\n├─ 피로·심계·건망 → 심비양허\n├─ 더부룩함·담·흉민 → 담음·담위불화\n└─ 허번·자양부족 → 음혈부족 계열","links":[]},{"title":"3. 치법","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/insomnia/#3","text":"심비양허 → 보기양혈·안신 → 귀비탕\n담음 → 화담·이기 → 온담탕\n안신 본초 → 산조인","links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/guibi-tang/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/wendan-tang/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/herbs/ziziphus-seed/"]},{"title":"4. 경혈","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/insomnia/#4","text":"→ 신문 HT7\n→ 내관 PC6\n→ 삼음교 SP6\n→ 백회 GV20\n→ 불면 임상연구","links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/points/gv20-baihui/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/points/ht7-shenmen/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/points/pc6-neiguan/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/points/sp6-sanyinjiao/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/insomnia/#sleep-research"]}],"headings":[{"level":2,"title":"1. 수면 양상","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/insomnia/#1"},{"level":2,"title":"2. 변증","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/insomnia/#2"},{"level":2,"title":"3. 치법","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/insomnia/#3"},{"level":2,"title":"4. 경혈","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/insomnia/#4"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/points/gv20-baihui/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/points/ht7-shenmen/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/points/pc6-neiguan/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/points/sp6-sanyinjiao/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/insomnia/#sleep-research","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/guibi-tang/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/wendan-tang/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/herbs/ziziphus-seed/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations.","provenance":{"document_id":"MSA-DE077AD995F0CDB9","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/insomnia/","text_sha256":"befbd0f488407b639669c3b87ff18056c6af15b1f06e41f12d25df0aff657c2b","source_sha256":"5d4891abec6ac8afe1dd1bb0844754bfb56f6f7d2b396ec6323a04c682fafead","commit":"70e16fc9d1b2150b25bede390c75139a9a7d3ef1"}}
